{"project": "time-intervals", "file": "intervals.py", "requirements": "All inputs are integers. overlap_seconds: length of intersection of half-open intervals; reject end<start; non-overlap or empty interval gives zero. bucket_index: floor((timestamp-origin)/width), including negatives; width must be positive. remaining_ttl: ttl minus elapsed time, clamped to 0..ttl; future-created item retains ttl; reject ttl<0. Invalid values raise ValueError. Keep three signatures. Only integer arithmetic //, comparisons, if/return, ValueError/min/max; no imports, attributes, loops or other calls.", "source": "def overlap_seconds(start_a, end_a, start_b, end_b):
